libamixc99.so.1, the C99 and POSIX functions AMIX SVR4.0's libc lacks
(snprintf and friends, usleep, strcasecmp, __cxa_atexit, amix_cpu), as the
shared library amix-gcc-14 builds and links, in the AMIX sysroot
/opt/m68k-amix-sysroot/usr/lib, with amixc99.pc, amix_cpu.h and the C99
headers for gcc 2.7 under usr/local and its link stub for AMIX.
